  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The reflection continues as the episode nears its finale. Max talks about the perfect illusions we create for ourselves. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы очень часто существуем в иллюзиях.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это наши фантазии.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы забываем о том, кто мы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Кто мы на самом деле?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Все играют роли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это чужие маски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Но наступает момент пробуждения.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Жизнь срывает с нас эти маски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Они были бесконечные.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Свет оголяет реальность.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы видим правду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы были к ней не готовы.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to the next part.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы очень часто существуем в иллюзиях.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We very often exist in illusions.' We build a perfect fake world.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это наши фантазии.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These are our fantasies.' We made them ourselves.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы забываем о том, кто мы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We forget who we are.' We lose our true identity.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Кто мы на самом деле?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are we really?' A deep philosophical question.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Все играют роли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone plays roles.' Like actors on a stage.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это чужие маски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These are foreign masks.' We pretend to be someone else.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Но наступает момент пробуждения.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But the moment of awakening comes.' Eventually, reality hits.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Жизнь срывает с нас эти маски.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Life tears these masks off us.' The truth is revealed abruptly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Они были бесконечные.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They were endless.' We have so many layers of deception.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Свет оголяет реальность.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Light lays bare the reality.' There is nowhere left to hide.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы видим правду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We see the truth.' The painful truth is finally visible.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы были к ней не готовы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We were not prepared for it.' It always comes as a shock. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
